the lines of this (you can go a bit bigger in the chest area if you want): https://skeb.jp/@yuki_shuri_0/works/26 \nShe's a cheerful, sexy but strong vampire character so have fun with that when it comes to the pose. Sexy is good as long as it's SFW.\nThank you! :)", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SeinSol/works/59", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1209986, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fe5dbc18/uploads/origins/baed05fe-acd4-4a7f-8f07-a7cb1b419d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=549782aeaa2780023c1242934885c7a4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fe5dbc18/uploads/origins/baed05fe-acd4-4a7f-8f07-a7cb1b419d72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d3e9b6efb7e91c3ec3d3278dcce0dac6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "お久しぶりです、前のリクエストありがとうございます。https://skeb.jp/@SeinSol/works/49\n今回はその続きで描ける範囲で頼みます、内容は\n･服に仕込んだ風船をヤケクソで2段階程更に膨らませ結構丸い大きさの胸に、でも服はボタンも取れずパツパツのままなんとか収まっている状態\n･メジャーで胸のサイズを測ったり（何cmかサイズはお任せします）\n･その場で飛んで胸をボインボインと揺らし\n･座りながら片手で後ろを支え、もう一方の手で胸をユッサユッサと擦って少し上を見上げながら｢ふぅ…｣と息を洩らす（イメージとしては満腹状態で腹を擦ってるみたいな感じで）\n･疲れて胸を枕にして休むなど割と大きな胸を楽しんでいる模様\nな感じで宜しくお願いします。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@SeinSol/works/58", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/104b49e1/uploads/origins/6db481f2-b867-43e1-b42b-4771dbc83024?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=30dc20eeeb6e668d17dc883196b61103", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1209986, "client_id": 2298572, "vtt_url":